---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
const title = 'Supplier Introductions for B2B Businesses | Proof to Partner';
const description = 'Help Proof to Partner understand your products, services, delivery capabilities and coverage for potentially relevant commercial opportunities.';
const breadcrumbs = [{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'For suppliers', path: '/for-suppliers/' }];
---
<SiteLayout title={title} description={description} canonicalPath="/for-suppliers/" breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}>
<section class="section-space"><div class="container-shell grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_.72fr] lg:items-center lg:gap-20"><div><p class="eyebrow">For suppliers and service providers</p><h1 class="display-heading mt-6 max-w-3xl text-5xl font-semibold sm:text-6xl">Help us understand what you can deliver—and where.</h1><p class="prose-copy mt-7 text-lg">A useful supplier profile is specific about capability, coverage and fit. It helps distinguish opportunities that suit your business from introductions that would waste everyone's time.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row"><a class="btn-primary" href="/contact/?type=supplier">Share supplier capabilities <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="btn-secondary" href="/how-it-works/">See the process</a></div></div><aside class="rounded-3xl bg-ink p-7 text-white sm:p-9"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#a4d4c7]">What is useful to share</p><ul class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm leading-6 text-white/80">{['Core products or service lines','Regions and delivery coverage','Typical client or project profile','Relevant certifications or compliance capabilities','Capacity, lead times and practical limitations','A company website or non-confidential capability statement'].map((item) => <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-[#a4d4c7]" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>{item}</li>)}</ul><p class="mt-7 border-t border-white/15 pt-5 text-xs leading-5 text-white/60">Do not share proprietary pricing, customer data or confidential documents unless you have permission.</p></aside></div></section>
<section class="border-y border-line bg-white py-16"><div class="container-shell grid gap-7 md:grid-cols-3"><div><span class="text-sm font-bold text-brand">01</span><h2 class="mt-3 text-lg font-semibold">Describe your fit</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">Explain what you do, what you do particularly well and the requirements you can realistically support.</p></div><div><span class="text-sm font-bold text-brand">02</span><h2 class="mt-3 text-lg font-semibold">Make constraints visible</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">Coverage, capacity, lead times, minimum order sizes and other limits help avoid unsuitable opportunities.</p></div><div><span class="text-sm font-bold text-brand">03</span><h2 class="mt-3 text-lg font-semibold">Consider a specific opportunity</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">If a relevant buyer-side requirement emerges, we may ask whether you are interested before any introduction is made.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="container-shell py-16 sm:py-20"><div class="max-w-3xl"><h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">No promises of volume or placement</h2><p class="prose-copy mt-5">Submitting supplier information does not guarantee referrals, opportunities, exclusivity, procurement approval or revenue. Any proposed commercial arrangement must be discussed and agreed before proceeding. Your information is not an automatic invitation to share your details with prospective buyers.</p><a class="mt-7 inline-flex font-semibold text-brand-deep underline underline-offset-4" href="/contact/?type=supplier">Introduce your business →</a></div></section>
</SiteLayout>